  "livestreamNotSetUpTitle": "Livestreams are not set up",
  "livestreamNotSetUpBody": "A livestream needs a media server: one person sends video and everybody else receives it, which cannot be done device to device the way a call is.\n\nThis Privio server has none configured, so there is nothing to join yet. Whoever runs it can set one up.",
