  "livestreamEndIt": "End it",
  "livestreamNobodyStreaming": "Nobody is streaming right now.",
  "livestreamCouldNotStart": "Could not start the stream.",

  "translationNotSetUpTitle": "Auto-translation is not set up",
  "translationNotSetUpBody": "Translating a post means sending what it says to a translation service. Privio's server cannot do that — it holds ciphertext and no key — so it would have to happen on your device, and the text would leave it in the clear.\n\nThat is a decision for whoever runs this server to enable and for each reader to agree to, so it is off until both have happened. No post has been sent anywhere.",

  "visibilityPublicTitle": "This channel is public",
  "visibilityPrivateTitle": "This channel is private",
  "visibilityPublicBody": "Anyone can find it by name and read its posts. Its handle is @{handle}.\n\nPrivio cannot turn a public channel private after the fact: its name and description have been readable, and unsaying that is not something an app can do.",
  "@visibilityPublicBody": { "placeholders": { "handle": { "type": "String" } } },
  "visibilityPrivateBody": "It is not listed, not searchable, and reachable only through its invite link. Its name is encrypted with the channel key.\n\nMaking it public would publish that name, which is a decision Privio does not make on your behalf — create a public channel instead.",

  "discussionBody": "With this on, every post gets a thread underneath it. Comments are sealed with the same channel key as the post, so a device that cannot read the post cannot read the thread.\n\nTurning it off later hides the threads rather than deleting them.",
